+config SND_SOC_FS19XX
+	tristate "FourSemi FS19xx smart amplifier"
+	depends on I2C
+	select CRC16
+	select REGMAP_I2C
+	help
+	  Enable support for the FourSemi FS1958/FS19xx boosted class-D
+	  speaker amplifiers with I2S/TDM input and voltage/current sense.
+	  The board specific register setup, including the TDM slot
+	  selection, is loaded from the vendor preset file (fs19xx.fsm).
+	  Say M to build it as a module named snd-soc-fs19xx.
+
